Source landscape: The 2023 documentary universe is substantial and multilingual, spanning UN and government reports, Philippine courts and oversight bodies, human-rights NGOs, political-prisoner monitoring, academic datasets, local and international journalism, and official Marcos-administration statements. The strongest source families concern drug-war killings, red-tagging, political detention, journalist safety, security-force accountability, protest, private armed groups, and institutional remedies. Search results were treated as leads only; no evidence claims or scores were extracted.

